1
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,690
(THE YARNS)

2
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:15,540
Do you happen to know this person?
Including this person.

3
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:22,320
This person was the one who posted the clip
of Sky throwing rocks at her friend's head.

4
00:01:22,370 --> 00:01:25,650
You must expel her, Director.
I won't allow it.

5
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:28,910
Nattha, the parent who had
an issue with Miss Sookwan

6
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,540
She made Sky resign from the school.

7
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,150
Keep Sky safe and then
keep an eye on Miss Sookwan.

8
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:38,000
The body of a young woman was found
brutally murdered with dismemberment.

9
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,810
The victim wasn't a teacher.

10
00:01:39,890 --> 00:01:41,060
Or did we solve the riddle wrong?

11
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,250
This yarn doesn't have a code.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:48,720
You're stupid.
Now you're just a loser murderer.

13
00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:50,260
Look!

14
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:53,240
Her life depends on you guys.

15
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,390
Sky.

16
00:01:57,810 --> 00:02:00,700
This police officer will watch over you
instead of me.

17
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:06,030
He will follow you from a distance
and not interfere with you at all.

18
00:02:06,330 --> 00:02:07,710
Are you okay with that?

19
00:02:08,570 --> 00:02:10,450
And where are you going, officer?

20
00:02:10,910 --> 00:02:12,470
Are you not going to learn decoding anymore?

21
00:02:12,950 --> 00:02:16,150
Let's say tomorrow.
I'll come back to continue studying tomorrow.

22
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:19,340
Yes, you can continue studying tomorrow.

23
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:22,640
- Sky will go to the store first.
- Alright.

24
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:27,640
Sergeant, follow her from a distance. Don't be too close.

25
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,240
-She's not used to it yet. I'll leave her to you.
-Understood.

26
00:03:20,190 --> 00:03:21,040
Hey!

27
00:03:27,230 --> 00:03:28,150
Shit!

28
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:34,680
Hello, what's up?

29
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:38,650
- Lieutenant, Sky was kidnapped!
- Huh? What?

30
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:42,670
I was walking behind her and she was
kidnapped into a van.

31
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,500
Where is Sky now?

32
00:03:59,230 --> 00:04:00,070
Look!

33
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:04,040
This is the new victim
that I'm going to kill.

34
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:09,440
Is this enough evidence?

35
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,100
Look!

36
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:19,240
Stop moving or I'll kill you live on TV!

37
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,720
Her life depends on you guys.

38
00:04:48,170 --> 00:04:49,220
Sky!

39
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,240
Aren't you? Aren't you? Aren't you?

40
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:58,040
Aren't you? Aren't you? Aren't you?

41
00:05:00,290 --> 00:05:03,000
If you're really competent,
come save her in time.

42
00:05:03,350 --> 00:05:05,510
You have twelve hours.

43
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:09,660
If you think that
I'm looking down on you guys,

44
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,060
I'll give you ten hours.

45
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:16,090
If you're even a second late,
this bitch is dead.

46
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,270
The timer has started.

47
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:29,450
Sky hurts! Let Sky go!

48
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:31,560
What the hell are you whining about?

49
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,170
Come here!

50
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:38,210
Let go of Sky! Sky won't go. Let Sky go!

51
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,370
Sit there and look at the clock.

52
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,490
By ten hours...

53
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:09,090
if the police fail to rescue you,

54
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:12,300
you'll definitely be sent back
to your retard planet.

55
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,240
Inspector.

56
00:06:32,850 --> 00:06:35,840
Sky's phone and bag
were found at the scene.

57
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,050
Everybody, listen up.

58
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:41,510
Find the pictures
from the scene of the incident.

59
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,780
No matter if it's a department store,
please bring them all.

60
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:46,490
Contact that TV show
and request for the tape urgently.

61
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:48,200
Understood.

62
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:58,830
Keep working.

63
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:01,340
- Sir.
- Save the hostage.

64
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:05,850
Inspector.

65
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:08,550
What have you done?

66
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,320
Huh?

67
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:14,890
I ordered you to admit about
arresting the wrong culprit.

68
00:07:15,930 --> 00:07:17,410
But you challenged the murderer.

69
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,540
How could you do that while being live?

70
00:07:20,050 --> 00:07:22,850
But it's the only way to lure him out.

71
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:27,300
Theory from your father's books, right?

72
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:29,810
So how is it now?

73
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,650
The PD couldn't be more embarrassing.

74
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,190
Huh?

75
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:38,190
Are you satisfied the the PD receiving
heavy backlash like this?

76
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:40,250
Have you ever read the online backlash?

77
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:42,710
How people have criticized
your competency?

78
00:07:43,370 --> 00:07:45,040
How heavily the PD was reprimanded?

79
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:46,400
I know.

80
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:48,530
For this case...

81
00:07:48,930 --> 00:07:50,380
I will take full responsibility
for everything.

82
00:07:50,450 --> 00:07:52,050
It's certain, Inspector!

83
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,180
And if this time...

84
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,360
the hostage was even slightly injured,

85
00:07:58,490 --> 00:07:59,580
you can find a new job.

86
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:10,550
Sir.

87
00:08:11,810 --> 00:08:12,440
Please take a look.

88
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:14,570
Footage from CCTV cameras in Bangkok.

89
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:23,680
Track this car.

90
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:26,050
- Find out where it went. Go!
- Understood.

91
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:30,660
You can't enter, Miss Sookwan.

92
00:08:31,050 --> 00:08:31,960
Miss Sookwan.

93
00:08:32,210 --> 00:08:33,780
- You can't enter.
- Get out of the way.

94
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:36,440
I'm going to find that damn police officer.
Get out of the way.

95
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,360
- You can't enter. Calm down, Miss Sookwan.
- Get out of the way.

96
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:42,340
- You are not authorized to enter.
- Get out of the way.

97
00:08:44,590 --> 00:08:46,560
You said you would take care of my child.

98
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:49,400
What can police like you capable of then?

99
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:51,630
Only care about arresting the culprit,

100
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:54,250
without regard to other people's lives.

101
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,790
- I'm sorry.
- Are you?

102
00:08:58,190 --> 00:09:00,130
Can your apology bring Sky back to me?

103
00:09:01,890 --> 00:09:04,830
Just you wait and see if something happens to Sky.

104
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:08,960
I will not let you live in peace, just wait and see.

105
00:09:10,570 --> 00:09:12,260
Ma'am! Ma'am!

106
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,580
-It's illegal to hurt an officer.
-Sergeant.

107
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:18,930
I won't just hurt you

108
00:09:19,410 --> 00:09:22,080
I'll even kill you if anything happens to Sky.

109
00:09:22,890 --> 00:09:24,470
Do not think that I do not dare.

110
00:09:25,830 --> 00:09:27,750
Instead of blaming the inspector like this,

111
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:30,530
should you let him look for Sky?

112
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:34,750
We don't have much time left.
We still don't know where Sky is.

113
00:09:36,770 --> 00:09:37,550
Sky and I...

114
00:09:37,810 --> 00:09:39,370
We have a location tracker via GPS.

115
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:44,000
Sky...

116
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,940
Sky's phone.

117
00:09:48,610 --> 00:09:50,750
It was found at the scene
where Sky had been kidnapped.

118
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,970
Is Sky safe?

119
00:10:06,090 --> 00:10:07,620
- Turn up the sound.
- Right.

120
00:10:08,990 --> 00:10:10,500
It's me.

121
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:13,590
The serial killer you guys are looking for.

122
00:10:16,330 --> 00:10:17,510
How can I be sure?

123
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:20,140
That you are the real murderer
and not just calling to prank me.

124
00:10:20,380 --> 00:10:21,420
Noppachai,

125
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:22,890
Nattha,

126
00:10:23,780 --> 00:10:24,680
Isriya,

127
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:26,800
Anon, Phongsak,

128
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:28,220
Naphat.

129
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:33,060
Did I call out the names of the victims
in the correct order?

130
00:10:33,970 --> 00:10:36,290
Can you cut out the other voices
and just keep the killer's voice alone?

131
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,000
Sure.

132
00:10:39,070 --> 00:10:41,330
I want two files, one with the killer's voice.

133
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:43,430
Another with the ambient sound,
please separate it for me.

134
00:10:44,230 --> 00:10:45,820
This is the most that can be cut, Inspector.

135
00:10:55,490 --> 00:10:57,110
Lan, let's eat something.

136
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,390
I'm not hungry at all.

137
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,350
- Lan, but you haven't eaten anything since...
- You eat it.

138
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:03,440
If anything happens to Sky,

139
00:11:03,890 --> 00:11:05,120
I will feel guilty for the rest of my life.

140
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:06,830
Lan.

141
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,800
- Land seems very worried about Sky.
- It's done, Inspector.

142
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,720
It's me.

143
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:16,200
The serial killer you guys are looking for.

144
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:19,040
Rewind, rewind it from the top.

145
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:21,700
- Can you turn up the volume?
- It's me.

146
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:22,780
This is the loudest.

147
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:25,680
Can you make it louder?

148
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:29,260
This is the loudest.

149
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:32,830
Right here, rewind.

150
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:36,500
Did I call out the names of the victims
in the correct order?

151
00:11:39,330 --> 00:11:39,870
Ship.

152
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,980
The riverside.

153
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:44,700
The riverside.

154
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,450
The riverside here.

155
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,340
The riverside.

156
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:50,610
Too wide.

157
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:53,420
It's too wide. It's too wide. Too wide.

158
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:56,290
Rewind.

159
00:11:56,500 --> 00:11:57,310
Sir.

160
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:02,400
It's me.

161
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,380
What are you doing?

162
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,040
Nothing.

163
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:03,770
I'm not hungry, you eat it.

164
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:05,360
Are you not hungry

165
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,010
because you worried about Lan?

166
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,380
He probably isn't hungry.

167
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,780
He is worried about the hostage.

168
00:13:22,190 --> 00:13:23,010
I think so.

169
00:13:24,690 --> 00:13:27,640
Lan should be more worried about Sky individually
not as a hostage.

170
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:37,920
It's nothing.

171
00:13:38,450 --> 00:13:39,260
Don't think too much.

172
00:13:42,970 --> 00:13:44,210
Eat now.

173
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:57,900
Eat first.

174
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:00,790
Come on.

175
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:04,870
Just a bite.

176
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,590
Give it to me.

177
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:20,930
Which girl texted you?

178
00:14:21,490 --> 00:14:25,260
-You should go home. It's past 11:00 p.m.
-Not a girl.

179
00:14:28,420 --> 00:14:29,070
Shit!

180
00:14:31,050 --> 00:14:31,900
Sis!

181
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:41,860
Smile for the camera.

182
00:14:42,210 --> 00:14:44,380
Just smile for the fucked-up world.

183
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:47,800
The world you'll be living in
for just three more hours.

184
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,570
Smile a little.

185
00:14:50,970 --> 00:14:54,990
I told you to smile.
You don't understand what I'm saying. Huh? Smile!

186
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:58,870
Stop.

187
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:01,350
Zoom in.

188
00:15:02,530 --> 00:15:03,240
Zoom in.

189
00:15:04,710 --> 00:15:05,410
Zoom in further.

190
00:15:06,890 --> 00:15:08,830
Zoom. Zoom in the window.

191
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:10,680
That's the Rama IX Bridge.

192
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:19,610
An extensive renovation.

193
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:26,100
If you see the top of the Rama IX Bridge,
it means the hostage is on the tall building.

194
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:28,690
There are many tall buildings
along the Chao Phraya River.

195
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:31,180
Which buildings?

196
00:15:31,830 --> 00:15:33,520
Come on! Which buildings?

197
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:18,270
What did you buy, officer?

198
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:20,710
Here.

199
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:24,560
I give you.

200
00:16:26,070 --> 00:16:30,610
Well, consider this as a teaching tool.

201
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,920
To teach me Morse Code.

202
00:16:56,730 --> 00:16:57,580
Park here.

203
00:17:00,430 --> 00:17:02,130
Where are you going? You're not wearing a helmet.

204
00:17:02,670 --> 00:17:05,040
Give us some slack.
I went to buy cigarettes. My house is right in the alley.

205
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,300
Have you ever seen the person in this picture?

206
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,510
- I've never seen her.
- Are you sure?

207
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:11,760
I'm sure.

208
00:17:12,250 --> 00:17:12,760
Go.

209
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:38,240
Hello, any updates?

210
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:40,510
Inspector.

211
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:43,150
Our patrol reported seeing strange blinking lights.

212
00:17:43,450 --> 00:17:46,670
- From the buildings around the Rama IX Bridge.
- Tell them to send us the footage.

213
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:48,560
Send us the footage.

214
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:03,100
Dot-dot...

215
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:05,600
Dot-dash-dash-dash-dot-dot-dot.

216
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:12,850
Dot-dot-dot-dash-dash-dash-dot-dot-dot.

217
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,060
SOS.

218
00:18:16,710 --> 00:18:17,980
Sky is asking for help!

219
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:19,750
Give me the coordinates.

220
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:21,630
Give me the coordinates quickly.

221
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:25,620
-Got it, Inspector.
-Let's go!

222
00:18:25,890 --> 00:18:27,020
We have 45 minutes. Let's go!

223
00:18:39,030 --> 00:18:41,570
What the hell are you playing, you bitch?

224
00:18:42,070 --> 00:18:45,580
If you don't stop causing trouble,
you're going to die before your time.

225
00:18:55,060 --> 00:18:57,770
In half an hour, prepare to die.

226
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:02,520
I'll livestream and kill you for the police.

227
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,280
Which floor did the light come from?

228
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:46,330
The light has stopped.

229
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:47,660
The light has stopped.

230
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:49,820
- How many floors does the building have?
- Twenty-six floors, sir.

231
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:52,130
Split up and search every floor and every room.

232
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:54,920
- Be careful of the hostage.
- Yes, sir! Let's go!

233
00:20:01,690 --> 00:20:03,640
Aren't you? Aren't you? Aren't you?

234
00:20:07,430 --> 00:20:08,450
If you're really competent,

235
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:10,160
come save her in time.

236
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:12,780
You have twelve hours.

237
00:20:32,770 --> 00:20:33,710
Come here.

238
00:20:33,850 --> 00:20:35,540
Sit down.

239
00:20:40,190 --> 00:20:41,820
Hello, you dumbass police.

240
00:20:42,230 --> 00:20:45,960
I warned you. If you are even a second late,
I won't spare her.

241
00:20:49,060 --> 00:20:50,720
Prepare to die!

242
00:21:04,090 --> 00:21:05,440
Fifteen.

243
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,760
Fourteen.

244
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,310
Thirteen.

245
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:16,360
Eleven.

246
00:21:22,540 --> 00:21:23,500
Six.

247
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:24,660
Five.

248
00:21:25,010 --> 00:21:25,680
Four.

249
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:45,720
Sky.

250
00:21:49,620 --> 00:21:50,560
It's okay, Sky.

251
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:54,640
You are safe now.

252
00:22:17,910 --> 00:22:19,040
-Arrest him.
-Roger.

253
00:22:29,190 --> 00:22:30,040
Sky.

254
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:35,980
Go, go!

255
00:23:37,140 --> 00:23:38,230
Let go!

256
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:40,480
-Hey!
-Get in the car.

257
00:23:40,970 --> 00:23:43,920
- Get in the car. Get in the car.
- Let me go!

258
00:23:49,330 --> 00:23:51,320
Sky! Sky!

259
00:23:51,950 --> 00:23:54,410
Sky? Are you alright? Are you hurt?

260
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:04,260
Are you hurt?

261
00:24:05,320 --> 00:24:06,320
You're safe now.

262
00:24:28,780 --> 00:24:29,490
Lan.

263
00:24:32,530 --> 00:24:33,580
Are you okay?

264
00:24:34,110 --> 00:24:34,780
I'm okay.

265
00:24:35,370 --> 00:24:36,780
I'll interrogate the culprit first.

266
00:24:56,380 --> 00:24:57,070
So...

267
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,850
you admitted that

268
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,900
you are the real murderer.

269
00:25:08,260 --> 00:25:09,410
Why the hell are you asking?

270
00:25:10,220 --> 00:25:13,690
Are you afraid of arresting the scapegoat
and receiving backlash big time?

271
00:25:16,580 --> 00:25:18,740
Your whole dumbass PD is so pathetic.

272
00:25:19,930 --> 00:25:22,730
Even after the culprit has been caught,
you still don't know if you got the right one.

273
00:25:24,770 --> 00:25:25,640
Fucking hilarious!

274
00:25:28,110 --> 00:25:28,780
Fine.

275
00:25:29,360 --> 00:25:30,230
So let's see.

276
00:25:38,770 --> 00:25:40,330
The first victim you killed...

277
00:25:43,360 --> 00:25:44,220
was Mr. Noppachai.

278
00:25:46,570 --> 00:25:47,800
The second victim...

279
00:25:49,180 --> 00:25:50,160
was Ms. Nattha.

280
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:53,780
The third victim was Ms. Isriya.

281
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,550
The fourth victim

282
00:25:56,980 --> 00:25:57,840
was Mr. Anon.

283
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:00,310
The fifth victim

284
00:26:01,130 --> 00:26:01,920
was Phra Phongsak.

285
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:05,060
And the sixth victim,

286
00:26:05,270 --> 00:26:06,040
your latest victim

287
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:08,350
was Ms. Raphat.

288
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:19,690
Dumbass Noppachai,

289
00:26:23,770 --> 00:26:24,750
stupid Nattha,

290
00:26:28,050 --> 00:26:29,090
idiot Isriya,

291
00:26:31,930 --> 00:26:32,880
moron Anon,

292
00:26:34,530 --> 00:26:35,470
retard Phongsak,

293
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:37,640
bitch Raphat.

294
00:26:39,610 --> 00:26:41,640
Do you think you can mess with me?

295
00:26:42,180 --> 00:26:42,900
Why?

296
00:26:43,500 --> 00:26:45,460
You still don't believe that I'm the murderer?

297
00:26:49,660 --> 00:26:50,420
Fine.

298
00:26:51,460 --> 00:26:52,520
Then tell me

299
00:26:54,490 --> 00:26:55,360
about

300
00:26:56,440 --> 00:27:00,400
the purpose of the killing
and the connection of each victim.

301
00:27:01,180 --> 00:27:02,780
It's because I have Killer Genes.

302
00:27:03,830 --> 00:27:05,890
The Genes that your father invented

303
00:27:05,910 --> 00:27:08,640
and labeled me as a murderer
since the day I was born.

304
00:27:10,830 --> 00:27:14,320
Here, I'm already doing it for his sake.
Are you happy now?

305
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:19,010
Are you telling me that you knitted

306
00:27:19,370 --> 00:27:23,180
And then leave the yarn with every corpse
to connect and destroy Dr. Chonlathorn's reputation?

307
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:25,220
So, did it work?

308
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:33,500
Fine.

309
00:27:35,850 --> 00:27:36,590
So let's see.

310
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:42,660
The riddle you left behind with each corpse.

311
00:27:45,310 --> 00:27:46,170
The first corpse

312
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:48,420
was the bank employee.

313
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:54,040
The second corpse

314
00:27:54,930 --> 00:27:56,440
was the receptionist in the mall.

315
00:27:58,330 --> 00:27:59,430
The third corpse

316
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:01,850
was the convenience store cashier.

317
00:28:03,420 --> 00:28:04,430
The fourth corpse

318
00:28:05,280 --> 00:28:08,540
was a monk, and the last one was a sex worker.

319
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:13,410
The last piece of yarn.

320
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,650
You didn't leave any riddles.

321
00:28:21,940 --> 00:28:23,030
Am I right?

322
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:29,280
Now, let me ask you this.

323
00:28:29,520 --> 00:28:31,080
I've already admitted that I'm a murderer.

324
00:28:31,600 --> 00:28:32,640
You can arrest me.

325
00:28:32,890 --> 00:28:36,910
Arrest me so I can go on TV
and let everyone know what your father did to me.

326
00:28:37,320 --> 00:28:40,480
- Why the fuck are you keep asking questions?
- Because you're not the real murderer!

327
00:28:41,070 --> 00:28:47,050
I am the real serial killer who has killed six people.
If I can get out, I will kill.

328
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:49,090
-Kill, kill, kill them all.
-The real murderer...

329
00:28:49,180 --> 00:28:51,260
left the riddles revealing that they have ten victims!

330
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:54,900
And in the riddle hidden in the last yarn

331
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:56,310
that was found with the monk

332
00:28:57,220 --> 00:29:00,370
revealed that the next victim was supposed
to be a teacher, not a sex worker!

333
00:29:03,100 --> 00:29:04,840
You're not the real murderer.

334
00:29:05,460 --> 00:29:06,480
You're just a copycat killer.

335
00:29:07,110 --> 00:29:07,950
No!

336
00:29:08,060 --> 00:29:09,140
I'm not a copycat!

337
00:29:09,260 --> 00:29:12,740
I'm the real yarn murderer!
I'm the real yarn murderer!

338
00:29:12,780 --> 00:29:15,480
I'm not a copycat! I'm not a copycat!

339
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:21,710
I'm the real yarn murderer!
I'm the real yarn murderer!

340
00:29:22,290 --> 00:29:23,370
A copycat killer?

341
00:29:24,860 --> 00:29:25,480
Yes, sir.

342
00:29:26,280 --> 00:29:28,850
This culprit was not
the serial killer we are looking for.

343
00:29:29,220 --> 00:29:31,410
So how can you be sure
they're not the same person?

344
00:29:34,190 --> 00:29:38,760
Evidence from forensic science and forensics consistently reports a change in the method of murder.

345
00:29:39,200 --> 00:29:41,660
This culprit killed a victim at another place

346
00:29:42,050 --> 00:29:43,670
but left the body where we found it.

347
00:29:44,110 --> 00:29:45,580
This pattern is different from
the real murderer's.

348
00:29:46,670 --> 00:29:49,750
And there was no hidden riddle in the yarn,
we found with the body.

349
00:29:50,730 --> 00:29:56,300
And most importantly, the victim who died
didn't match the hint in the previous riddle.

350
00:30:00,020 --> 00:30:01,450
It means that the real killer is on the loose.

351
00:30:04,320 --> 00:30:06,340
So what will you tell the people?

352
00:30:10,310 --> 00:30:12,240
On behalf of the Royal Thai Police,

353
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:16,360
I would like to accept responsibility for the hasty conclusion of the serial murder case.

354
00:30:17,410 --> 00:30:19,010
The PD would like to admit that...

355
00:30:20,050 --> 00:30:21,530
he was not the real culprit.

356
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,940
But the PD did not remain indifferent.

357
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:27,460
In the part of the culprit
who killed Ms. Raphat,

358
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:30,850
kidnapped and attempted
to murder Miss Sky,

359
00:30:31,610 --> 00:30:33,490
the PD would like to reaffirm that

360
00:30:34,350 --> 00:30:36,260
he is not a real serial killer.

361
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,290
As for the real culprit,

362
00:30:39,780 --> 00:30:42,180
they will definitely be arrested
and prosecuted according to the law.

363
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:50,330
Hey, here he comes!

364
00:30:52,300 --> 00:30:53,920
I have a freaking Killer Genes!

365
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,990
I have a freaking Killer Genes!

366
00:30:59,850 --> 00:31:02,010
I'm a human like you, right?
You dumbass Chonlathorn!

367
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:07,310
You ruined my life!
You made me a fucking monster in the society!

368
00:31:10,230 --> 00:31:13,810
Whoever has this gene,
come out and kill them all.

369
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:16,640
Come out and kill! Be the monster
they label us to be!

370
00:31:16,810 --> 00:31:19,500
Come on, come out! Everyone, come out!

371
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:38,890
How is the feedback now?

372
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:44,960
The people are divided into two groups.
Most of them agree with you.

373
00:31:45,910 --> 00:31:48,950
Moreover, this copycat killer also has Killer Genes.

374
00:31:49,370 --> 00:31:51,190
People have more faith in the law
that controls them.

375
00:31:55,090 --> 00:31:56,240
And the group that disagrees?

376
00:32:07,030 --> 00:32:10,560
The opposite group is made up of people
who really have killer genes,

377
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:14,620
but there aren't many of them because
they're under control and it's under curfew.

378
00:32:15,340 --> 00:32:21,340
The rest don't have the Killer Genes,
but come out to demand freedom and rights

379
00:32:21,780 --> 00:32:25,390
This group is becoming more violent
and influential every day.

380
00:32:34,450 --> 00:32:35,910
How can you be sure

381
00:32:36,050 --> 00:32:39,880
that if the law to control people
with Killer Genes is actually enforced,

382
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:43,180
our society will truly be free from crime?

383
00:32:44,980 --> 00:32:47,920
It probably won't be completely crime-free.

384
00:32:49,630 --> 00:32:50,700
I'd rather say it this way.

385
00:32:51,750 --> 00:32:56,140
Suppose you were diagnosed
with a malignant tumor in your body.

386
00:32:56,870 --> 00:32:59,130
It might not be a very big lump.

387
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:02,140
-But is it there, right?
-That's right.

388
00:33:02,700 --> 00:33:06,210
Do you think you'll keep it or cut it out?

389
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:10,120
If you ask me like this,
I have to say that I will cut it out.

390
00:33:10,960 --> 00:33:11,530
That's right.

391
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:16,560
But this is a country. We cannot exclude anyone.

392
00:33:17,070 --> 00:33:19,230
So we need to control them.

393
00:33:20,210 --> 00:33:21,150
Just think about it.

394
00:33:21,620 --> 00:33:27,190
If we know that there are up to twenty percent
of the sixty million population

395
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:29,880
who are capable of committing crimes,

396
00:33:30,340 --> 00:33:35,500
can we stand not helping to reduce the risk
of injuries, deaths, or loss?

397
00:33:37,910 --> 00:33:39,130
Twenty percent.

398
00:33:39,630 --> 00:33:42,320
Twenty percent is about twelve million people.

399
00:33:42,780 --> 00:33:44,220
They're all over the country.

400
00:33:45,910 --> 00:33:48,850
But this is just a draft of the Law.

401
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:51,600
We have to wait for the people
to vote in a referendum.

402
00:33:52,660 --> 00:33:56,920
Shouldn't we let people choose
the society they want to live in?

403
00:33:57,580 --> 00:34:00,780
Official referendum results

404
00:34:00,930 --> 00:34:02,720
fifty-one percent of the people

405
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:07,220
accepting the draft of the Law to control the behavior
of those with Killer Genes.

406
00:34:07,340 --> 00:34:13,300
Effective from April 25, 2000.

407
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:16,780
Requires all Thais to be tested for Killer Genes,

408
00:34:17,220 --> 00:34:21,230
from newborns to high school children.

409
00:34:21,300 --> 00:34:24,660
If the Killer Genes are found,
they must attend a special control school.

410
00:34:24,940 --> 00:34:26,340
It is a boarding school.

411
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:28,780
They cannot study among
the other children.

412
00:34:29,330 --> 00:34:35,000
Those in higher education
can choose to study at the institution they want.

413
00:34:35,161 --> 00:34:38,532
But you are not allowed to study Medicine, Pharmacy,

414
00:34:38,709 --> 00:34:41,523
Aviation Engineering, Royal Police Cadet Academy,

415
00:34:41,808 --> 00:34:43,457
and all Military Academy.

416
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:48,542
Anyone with the Killer Genes must report to the police

417
00:34:48,925 --> 00:34:51,580
at the police station near your home
every three months

418
00:34:51,794 --> 00:34:55,742
If violated, the movement will be restricted
for a specified period.

419
00:34:56,984 --> 00:34:58,229
Did I do something wrong?

420
00:35:02,267 --> 00:35:04,476
What you did is right.

421
00:35:04,780 --> 00:35:07,509
Time has proven that what you did is right.

422
00:35:07,589 --> 00:35:10,073
You help the country be more peaceful

423
00:35:10,410 --> 00:35:12,149
Look at your popularity rating.

424
00:35:13,506 --> 00:35:15,106
Your IO is very good at their job.

425
00:35:34,780 --> 00:35:36,803
I have to thank you very much, Miss Sookwan,

426
00:35:37,276 --> 00:35:39,106
for communicating for us.

427
00:35:39,446 --> 00:35:41,182
Otherwise, it would be
more difficult to communicate.

428
00:35:41,492 --> 00:35:43,180
I would like to thank everyone as well,

429
00:35:43,224 --> 00:35:45,154
for rescuing Sky.

430
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:51,415
But I still blame the police
for causing the incident.

431
00:35:58,372 --> 00:36:00,866
How are you doing now, Sky?

432
00:36:01,906 --> 00:36:02,831
You're not scared anymore, right?

433
00:36:03,339 --> 00:36:08,514
Sky is fine now, but the officer is still not fine.

434
00:36:08,633 --> 00:36:09,676
Does it hurt?

435
00:36:11,433 --> 00:36:12,205
It doesn't hurt.

436
00:36:12,911 --> 00:36:13,989
It was far from the heart.

437
00:36:14,448 --> 00:36:15,874
"Far from the heart."

438
00:36:16,720 --> 00:36:18,685
If it's close to your heart, will it hurt?

439
00:36:19,558 --> 00:36:21,920
But when I got my hair pulled,

440
00:36:22,208 --> 00:36:25,311
it was far from my heart,
I was hurt, it hurt a lot.

441
00:36:25,888 --> 00:36:28,928
- Sky...
- Sweetheart...

442
00:36:29,645 --> 00:36:33,276
You've talked too much.
Let's go back so the officer can do his job.

443
00:36:35,353 --> 00:36:37,732
-Hello, Miss Sookwan.
-Hello.

444
00:36:41,853 --> 00:36:44,702
Let's go. His girlfriend is here.

445
00:36:45,506 --> 00:36:46,278
Miss Sookwan.

446
00:36:46,780 --> 00:36:49,238
You probably misunderstood something.

447
00:36:49,899 --> 00:36:51,773
Anya and I are close friends.

448
00:36:53,860 --> 00:36:55,398
Yes, we are friends.

449
00:36:56,309 --> 00:36:58,233
But it looks like a good match.

450
00:36:58,780 --> 00:37:01,151
-Excuse me. Let's go.
-I'll see you out.

451
00:37:45,881 --> 00:37:48,274
Sky, what are you doing, honey?

452
00:37:48,688 --> 00:37:51,902
I saw you put the scotch tape on and off
since yesterday.

453
00:37:52,250 --> 00:37:53,384
What is this?

454
00:37:54,514 --> 00:37:56,121
Flashlight keychain.

455
00:37:57,780 --> 00:38:00,629
If it's broken, just throw it away.
I will buy you a new one.

456
00:38:00,939 --> 00:38:02,713
No, no, no, I won't throw it away.

457
00:38:02,977 --> 00:38:06,024
This is what the police officer bought for Sky.

458
00:38:26,337 --> 00:38:27,339
Sky.

459
00:38:31,363 --> 00:38:32,323
It's okay, Sky.

460
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:36,520
Sky, you are safe now.

461
00:39:01,252 --> 00:39:02,000
Sky.

462
00:39:47,600 --> 00:39:49,916
You have really grown up.

463
00:40:07,412 --> 00:40:08,841
Here, have some coffee.

464
00:40:12,751 --> 00:40:13,565
What?

465
00:40:17,721 --> 00:40:18,747
What a shame!

466
00:40:20,040 --> 00:40:21,916
You were supposed to see
the person who was stabbed.

467
00:40:23,245 --> 00:40:25,060
Instead, you got your heart stabbed with those words.

468
00:40:26,520 --> 00:40:27,405
I get it now.

469
00:40:27,979 --> 00:40:28,946
When people say that

470
00:40:29,634 --> 00:40:30,695
the word "friend"

471
00:40:31,304 --> 00:40:32,417
sometimes can cut the deepest.

472
00:40:33,714 --> 00:40:36,772
Ouch! It hurts!

473
00:40:40,083 --> 00:40:41,210
Go ahead, sis.

474
00:40:41,547 --> 00:40:42,671
Stab me.

475
00:40:43,180 --> 00:40:46,880
I will let you,
if that's gonna make you feel better.

476
00:40:48,170 --> 00:40:49,554
Go ahead. Oh!

477
00:40:54,041 --> 00:40:54,984
I...

478
00:40:56,271 --> 00:40:58,685
I also see you as...

479
00:40:59,572 --> 00:41:00,410
As...

480
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,561
As...

481
00:41:02,100 --> 00:41:03,113
a little brother.

482
00:41:09,641 --> 00:41:10,469
It really hurts.

483
00:41:19,457 --> 00:41:22,591
Do you still believe that
the killer is Miss Sookwan?

484
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:25,480
I don't believe it 100 percent.

485
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:30,546
But I feel that Ms. Sookwan
has a strange attitude.

486
00:41:31,080 --> 00:41:32,073
It's like she's hiding something.

487
00:41:33,749 --> 00:41:36,360
But there are still no other clues.

488
00:41:37,492 --> 00:41:39,015
Would you like me to continue following her?

489
00:41:39,297 --> 00:41:42,264
If that's the case, I'll follow Sookwan tomorrow.

490
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:44,817
I will try my best to get into her house too.

491
00:41:47,161 --> 00:41:51,989
Order all units to thoroughly patrol
every school in Bangkok,

492
00:41:52,441 --> 00:41:54,194
especially Arunpanya School.

493
00:41:54,765 --> 00:41:57,363
I believe the next victim will come from this school.

494
00:41:57,850 --> 00:42:00,918
Yes, sir. I'll go take care of it right away.

495
00:42:01,881 --> 00:42:02,768
Just a sec, Sergeant.

496
00:42:02,897 --> 00:42:06,800
If you have the chance,
I'd like you to ask Rapee

497
00:42:07,001 --> 00:42:11,391
whether she remembers anyone
who had issues with Sookwan and Sky.

498
00:42:11,707 --> 00:42:12,285
Alright.

499
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:56,420
Why do the police think that the murderer
would kill people in my school?

500
00:42:57,165 --> 00:43:00,504
Er... Don't worry about it. Leave it to the police.

501
00:43:02,507 --> 00:43:04,702
Tell me, I want to know.

502
00:43:05,641 --> 00:43:07,126
Who is the murderer going to kill?

503
00:43:08,264 --> 00:43:09,700
I don't know either.

504
00:43:10,285 --> 00:43:12,699
I only know that they are a teacher.

505
00:43:15,502 --> 00:43:18,253
But there are many teachers in many schools
around the country.

506
00:43:20,198 --> 00:43:22,580
The Inspector had the officers
keep an eye on everywhere,

507
00:43:22,653 --> 00:43:25,606
but he had me pay special attention
to your school.

508
00:43:28,048 --> 00:43:28,780
See?

509
00:43:29,380 --> 00:43:31,109
How can I not be worried?

510
00:43:32,380 --> 00:43:34,880
Tell me so that I will be careful.

511
00:43:36,966 --> 00:43:39,627
Is it related to Miss Sookwan?

512
00:43:40,208 --> 00:43:43,067
That day, your boss came to ask me
about Sky and Miss Sookwan.

513
00:43:44,236 --> 00:43:45,328
It's about her, right?

514
00:43:48,400 --> 00:43:51,773
But from everything you've told me,

515
00:43:52,455 --> 00:43:54,699
there aren't any teachers
who had an issue with Sookwan, right?

516
00:43:59,980 --> 00:44:00,796
Right.

517
00:44:01,074 --> 00:44:02,622
There aren't any.

518
00:44:04,904 --> 00:44:08,006
Tomorrow, I have a special class
with Miss Sookwan too.

519
00:44:08,410 --> 00:44:09,638
I'm scared.

520
00:44:10,640 --> 00:44:13,739
Don't be. I have to follow Sookwan anyway.

521
00:44:14,476 --> 00:44:15,137
Okay?

522
00:44:17,074 --> 00:44:17,836
Go on.

523
00:44:58,747 --> 00:44:59,680
Sky.

524
00:45:00,793 --> 00:45:02,121
What are you doing?

525
00:45:03,947 --> 00:45:05,029
Sky...

526
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:07,488
Sky is waiting for...

527
00:45:07,565 --> 00:45:08,918
Hello, Miss Sookwan.

528
00:45:10,876 --> 00:45:13,033
-Sky.
-Hello, officer.

529
00:45:13,540 --> 00:45:14,966
You are late today.

530
00:45:15,022 --> 00:45:18,754
You usually arrive at around 8:30,
but now you're 15 minutes late.

531
00:45:20,480 --> 00:45:23,700
There's a bit of a traffic jam today.

532
00:45:25,714 --> 00:45:26,688
That's alright.

533
00:45:37,060 --> 00:45:39,266
Please, come inside the house.

534
00:45:42,855 --> 00:45:47,906
Are you letting me into your house today?

535
00:45:48,170 --> 00:45:51,102
You are not a stranger,
not even an acquaintance.

536
00:45:51,551 --> 00:45:55,690
You saved Sky's life, so Sky considers
the police officer a friend.

537
00:45:56,633 --> 00:45:58,716
Friends can enter their homes. Please come in.

538
00:46:01,913 --> 00:46:03,391
Um, that's not good.

539
00:46:04,080 --> 00:46:06,942
A man and a woman are alone together.

540
00:46:07,304 --> 00:46:08,956
I think it's inappropriate.

541
00:46:09,342 --> 00:46:12,060
But he is Sky's friend now.

542
00:46:12,146 --> 00:46:14,219
-Friends can enter their friends' houses.
-Sky

543
00:46:14,556 --> 00:46:18,556
I think it's better for the Inspector to
watch over you from the outside.

544
00:46:18,939 --> 00:46:21,580
You'd better get in the house now.
And don't go anywhere.

545
00:46:21,958 --> 00:46:23,860
I will be back in the evening. Come on.

546
00:46:24,236 --> 00:46:25,662
Get into the house. Go in.

547
00:47:24,573 --> 00:47:26,142
Very good, take it slow.

548
00:47:27,210 --> 00:47:28,086
Please take it easy.

549
00:47:28,295 --> 00:47:29,846
Take it easy. Focus.

550
00:47:34,563 --> 00:47:35,283
Oh.

551
00:47:35,638 --> 00:47:37,234
How about this? Are you helping each other?

552
00:47:45,210 --> 00:47:49,053
Hey, is this table okay? Is it okay? Okay.

553
00:48:01,321 --> 00:48:03,899
But from everything you've told me,

554
00:48:04,205 --> 00:48:06,800
there aren't any teachers
who had an issue with Sookwan, right?

555
00:48:07,394 --> 00:48:09,812
Sky is a such problematic kid, Director.

556
00:48:10,306 --> 00:48:12,153
No one can communicate with her.

557
00:48:12,706 --> 00:48:13,878
No matter what I ask, she doesn't answer.

558
00:48:14,761 --> 00:48:17,085
Even when we talk, she doesn't even look at me.

559
00:48:17,906 --> 00:48:19,398
I told her to look at me but she wouldn't.

560
00:48:20,441 --> 00:48:22,396
Have you talked to the child's parents yet?

561
00:48:24,080 --> 00:48:28,706
We talked, but she cried and begged me
not to expel her kid.

562
00:48:29,360 --> 00:48:31,544
Because it is very difficult for her
to find a school for Sky.

563
00:48:32,706 --> 00:48:38,380
It's obvious that Sky
is not ready to live with other children.

564
00:48:41,916 --> 00:48:43,405
Director, please believe me.

565
00:48:45,495 --> 00:48:46,646
Please expel this kid.

566
00:48:47,561 --> 00:48:48,483
Ms. Rapeephan,

567
00:48:49,502 --> 00:48:50,573
What's wrong?

568
00:48:51,478 --> 00:48:52,780
Why do you look so pale?

569
00:48:57,780 --> 00:49:00,848
Um, no, it's nothing.

570
00:49:01,457 --> 00:49:04,473
I'll go to the bathroom first.
Please take care of the students.

571
00:49:18,271 --> 00:49:21,624
What? You're the one
who suggested expelling Sky from school?

572
00:49:22,520 --> 00:49:24,295
Well, at that time,
it was too much to bear.

573
00:49:24,827 --> 00:49:26,455
And no one knows

574
00:49:26,956 --> 00:49:28,156
what is autism,

575
00:49:28,598 --> 00:49:29,770
and how to cope with autism.

576
00:49:30,779 --> 00:49:32,622
It was really stressful at that time.

577
00:49:34,278 --> 00:49:35,526
I'm scared.

578
00:49:37,307 --> 00:49:38,267
That's alright.

579
00:49:38,970 --> 00:49:39,777
Don't be scared.

580
00:49:40,605 --> 00:49:43,262
At that time, besides you
and the former director,

581
00:49:43,610 --> 00:49:45,283
does anyone else know about this?

582
00:49:48,570 --> 00:49:49,648
Then it's okay.

583
00:49:50,201 --> 00:49:53,109
Keep this a secret, don't tell anyone, understand?

584
00:49:53,951 --> 00:49:56,139
Go back to the classroom
and do your job as usual.

585
00:49:56,664 --> 00:49:59,436
Don't let Sookwan suspect you at all.

586
00:50:40,504 --> 00:50:42,584
What are you looking for, officer?

587
00:50:43,526 --> 00:50:44,226
Oh.

588
00:50:45,728 --> 00:50:46,469
Nothing.

589
00:50:47,080 --> 00:50:49,728
It just so happens that I...

590
00:50:52,128 --> 00:50:56,180
I see that your house is beautiful,
so I want to look around.

591
00:50:57,126 --> 00:50:59,704
Can you give me a tour of the house?

592
00:51:00,966 --> 00:51:02,556
Of course. Sure.

593
00:51:03,005 --> 00:51:05,980
Sky will take you on a tour
of every corner.

594
00:51:18,932 --> 00:51:19,693
Welcome.

595
00:51:30,278 --> 00:51:31,293
Please.

596
00:51:35,800 --> 00:51:37,471
This is Sky's house.

597
00:51:44,991 --> 00:51:48,653
This is Sky's TV. And this is Sky's chair.

598
00:51:50,330 --> 00:51:53,690
This is Mother and Sky's dining table.

599
00:52:04,911 --> 00:52:08,476
What are you looking for, officer?
Can I help you find it?

600
00:52:09,147 --> 00:52:10,253
I'm not looking for anything.

601
00:52:11,356 --> 00:52:13,794
Your house is beautiful, so I look around.

602
00:52:13,933 --> 00:52:15,471
Please continue the tour.

603
00:52:29,885 --> 00:52:32,104
This is my mother's kitchen.

604
00:52:35,440 --> 00:52:37,603
And what is this room, Sky?

605
00:52:38,760 --> 00:52:40,114
Storage room.

606
00:52:41,405 --> 00:52:42,483
Storage room.

607
00:52:43,220 --> 00:52:45,318
Can you please let me see this room?

608
00:52:45,846 --> 00:52:47,836
There's nothing worth watching.

609
00:52:48,069 --> 00:52:51,165
There are so many of my mom's things, it's so messy.

610
00:52:55,530 --> 00:52:58,862
Oh, and the bathroom, Sky. I'd like to use the bathroom.

611
00:52:59,878 --> 00:53:02,278
Do you need to pee? Or do you need to poop?

612
00:53:03,380 --> 00:53:04,813
Er...

613
00:53:05,655 --> 00:53:06,643
I have to poop.

614
00:53:09,314 --> 00:53:13,440
The bathroom is over there, officer.
Please feel free to use it.

615
00:53:13,780 --> 00:53:17,373
Then you can wait for me in the living room.

616
00:53:17,780 --> 00:53:19,951
Feel free to take a poop, officer.

617
00:53:21,217 --> 00:53:22,194
Thank you.

618
00:54:42,960 --> 00:54:46,257
Hey, I'm following Sookwan. What are you doing?

619
00:54:46,716 --> 00:54:49,213
I'm preparing to teach my last class, darling.

620
00:54:49,593 --> 00:54:51,353
There's also a tutoring session this evening.

621
00:54:51,580 --> 00:54:52,841
I'm scared, baby.

622
00:54:53,175 --> 00:54:53,906
Don't be.

623
00:54:54,177 --> 00:54:55,561
I will not let Sookwan slip my sight.

624
00:54:55,791 --> 00:54:58,120
If Sookwan is the real killer,
then I must know first.

625
00:54:58,372 --> 00:55:00,852
After you off work, I'll pick you up.
Don't go anywhere alone.

626
00:57:30,600 --> 00:57:31,495
Shit!

627
00:57:44,246 --> 00:57:44,918
Huh?

628
00:57:45,460 --> 00:57:46,486
Miss Sookwan disappeared.

629
00:57:47,523 --> 00:57:48,563
I'm sorry.

630
00:57:54,445 --> 00:57:55,457
Sky and I...

631
00:57:55,711 --> 00:57:57,325
We have a location tracker via GPS.

632
00:57:59,690 --> 00:58:00,587
Wait a moment, Sergeant.

633
00:58:06,709 --> 00:58:09,286
- Sky. Sky.
- Yes?

634
00:58:09,864 --> 00:58:11,189
Can I borrow your phone?

635
00:58:12,313 --> 00:58:14,351
My phone's battery is dead.

636
00:58:16,229 --> 00:58:17,255
Sure.

637
00:58:19,980 --> 00:58:21,972
But don't use it too long
or the battery will run out.

638
00:58:22,326 --> 00:58:23,683
Yes, I won't take long.

639
00:58:37,965 --> 00:58:38,667
Sergeant.

640
00:58:39,363 --> 00:58:42,040
- Miss Sookwan is at Arunpanya School.
- Huh?

641
00:58:42,935 --> 00:58:44,156
Oh no, Rapee!

642
00:58:45,906 --> 00:58:47,370
Sergeant, Sergeant.

643
00:58:58,646 --> 00:59:01,683
Sky, thank you. Thank you.

644
00:59:44,845 --> 00:59:47,241
Come on!
